10 FIBONACCI NUMBERS AS BARS OF SOLID BLOCKS
20 CELLS  0 ROWS  1 A  2 B  3 BLOCK  4 NEW LINE  5 AND 6 SPARE
30 ++++++++++>+>+>>+++++++++++[<+++++++++++++>-]++++++++++<<<<
40 [                       FOR EACH ROW
50 >[>>>>+>+<<<<<-]        COPY A INTO CELLS 5 AND 6
60 >>>>>[<<<<<+>>>>>-]     AND CELL 6 BACK INTO A
70 <[<<.>>-]<.             PRINT A BLOCKS THEN A NEW LINE
80 <<<[>>>>+<<<<-]         A INTO CELL 5
90 >[<+>>>>>+<<<<-]        B INTO A AND CELL 6
100 >>>[<<<+>>>-]          CELL 5 INTO B
110 >[<<<<+>>>>-]          AND CELL 6 ONTO B
120 <<<<<<-]               ONE ROW FEWER
